# Local Claude Code Notes (template)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in machine-specific notes.

## Local venv paths (example)

- GPU venv: `.venv/` at repo root (CUDA 12.1)
- CPU-only venv: `.venv-cpu/` at repo root

## Model cache location (example)

- Docling model cache: `~/.cache/docling/` or wherever `prefetch-models` landed them

## Claude Code routines (example)

| Routine | ID | Schedule | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Doc drift | `trig_...` | Daily | Flag drift between code and docs |
